msgstr "\nReflections update every frame while the camera moves. The interval applies to a still camera. Renderer %s. With DLSS off, High uses native resolution and Ultra uses 125%% supersampling with 8× MSAA. Presets reset individual settings. Changes save automatically."

msgid "\n水体精度改变模拟、细波纹和水面网格；反射宽度与刷新频率独立可调。关闭阴影不会开启原本不投影的灯光。High / Ultra 默认逐帧计算焦散；这提高动画连续性，也增加 GPU 负担，不改变光子数量或波浪公式。"
msgstr "\nWater quality controls simulation, fine ripples and surface meshes. Reflection width and refresh are independent. High / Ultra update caustics every frame for smoother animation with additional GPU cost."

msgid "\nPC 近景阴影采用 5/14/60/120 米分配，保留原最远覆盖；High/Ultra 增加软阴影采样。更高滤波可能增加 GPU 负担，不会改变角色轮廓。"
msgstr "\nPC shadow splits use 5/14/60/120 metres. High / Ultra increase soft-shadow sampling and GPU cost."

msgid "\nTAA、SDFGI、SSAO 和 SSIL 仅支持 Forward+，不可用选项已禁用；本页不会假装即时更换渲染器。"
msgstr "\nTAA, SDFGI, SSAO and SSIL require Forward+. Unavailable options are disabled."

msgid "需要支持 NR 可调参数的新版自编译引擎；旧引擎继续使用原单层 NR。"
